{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhonghua-e-o075","title":"黄初中鹈鹕集灵芝池，诏公卿举独行君子，王朗荐杨彪且称疾让位","accounts":[{"id":"zhonghua-a-b4b8ada0b88b300039b6","label":"正文","text":"黄初中鹈鹕集灵芝池，诏公卿举独行君子，王朗荐杨彪且称疾让位","evidence":["zhonghua-q-74bec9736435a568cbb1"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-2f3216a8f64db086f15e","label":"正文","text":"帝为杨彪置吏卒位次三公，诏王朗勿复辞让，朗乃起","evidence":["zhonghua-q-299f68f497993f1b1c43"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0309","role":"荐彪且称疾让位者；受诏乃起者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-74bec9736435a568cbb1","zhonghua-q-299f68f497993f1b1c43"]},{"person":"wudi-p0153","role":"被荐被让位之光禄大夫；受置吏卒位次三公者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-74bec9736435a568cbb1","zhonghua-q-299f68f497993f1b1c43"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"为彪置吏卒并诏朗者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-299f68f497993f1b1c43"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhonghua-q-74bec9736435a568cbb1","zhonghua-q-299f68f497993f1b1c43"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhonghua-q-74bec9736435a568cbb1","source_order":[13,287,0],"order":2910}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0153","name":"杨彪","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0309","name":"王朗","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhonghua-q-299f68f497993f1b1c43","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-21a4174264161243ba15","layer":"original","quote":"帝乃为彪置吏卒，位次三公。诏曰：“朕求贤于君而未得，君乃翻然称疾〖1〗；非徒不得贤，更开失贤之路，增玉铉之倾〖2〗。无乃居其室出其言不善，见违于君子乎〖3〗？君其勿有后辞。”朗乃起。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":286,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":38,"end":129,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-74bec9736435a568cbb1","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-21a4174264161243ba15","layer":"original","quote":"黄初中，鹈鹕集灵芝池，诏公卿举独行君子。朗荐光禄大夫杨彪；且称疾，让位于彪。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"O